WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Sometimes the evidence changes. And the reason still sounds certain.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
A participant chooses a portrait. The choice is recorded.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The experimenter reveals the other portrait instead.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Some people miss the mismatch. They explain what they were handed.

5
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
A convincing account does not verify the original decision.

6
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Return to what was chosen. Johansson and colleagues, 2005.
